commit ea057c1cdf413e124ec480005c0376e3f3f2015f
Author: Muxite <muk.chunpongtong@gmail.com>
Date:   Thu Nov 5 11:30:43 2026 -0500

    Reference runner: detach helper stdin, never pull on finite image calls
    
    - git snapshot, docker helper and docker rm get stdin=DEVNULL. Under a stdio MCP
      server these children inherited the protocol pipe and a call hung.
    - Finite image docker run adds --pull=never, matching services.
    
    Found while running the runner under JiuwenSwarm (ai4r_ccv2 a838b9704).
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

diff --git a/AI4Research-Notebook/Designs/CC Protocols/reference/applications.py b/AI4Research-Notebook/Designs/CC Protocols/reference/applications.py
index afc6629..47deaaf 100644
